  "notes": [
   "The booklet is only small pictures, so the exact placement of some pieces is my best reading of it.",
   "The count of each type matches the parts list: 32 pieces.",
   "The 4x4 plate has 7 hinge plates clipped under it: 6 red 2-finger plates and the dark gray 1-finger-on-side plate (b2). Six black 1-finger hinge plates hinge onto the red ones to make the six legs.",
   "The red 1x2 and orange 1x2 sub-assembly (step 8 inset) sits on the dark gray 2-finger hinge b9. I attached b9 to b2 by a hinge.",
   "The black 2x4 plates and the black 2x3 plate lie on the black hinge plates as leg tips. Which hinge each one sits on is a guess.",
   "The two levers are the antennae. I put them on orange plates; the booklet does not show this clearly.",
   "Positions are left null as instructed."
  ]
 },
